# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Firebase Configuration for 100 Post Challenge App
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO GET THESE VALUES:
# 1. Visit https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Create / open your project
# 3. Project Settings → General → Your Apps → Add Web App
# 4. Copy each value from the firebaseConfig shown
# 5. Enable Google sign-in: Authentication → Sign-in method → Google
# 6. Create Firestore: Firestore Database → Create database (test mode)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project_id.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project_id.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_sender_id_here
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_app_id_here
